Weighing Lysimeter Experiments", "doi": "10.15482/USDA.ADC/1526332", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/24855858", "published_date": "2024-02-15T20:31:33Z", "thumb": "", "defined_type": 3, "defined_type_name": "dataset", "group_id": 51648, "url_private_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/account/articles/24855858", "url_public_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/24855858", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/24855858", "url_public_html": "https://agdatacommons.nal.usda.gov/articles/dataset/Soil_Water_Content_Data_for_The_Bushland_Texas_Large_Weighing_Lysimeter_Experiments/24855858", "timeline": {"posted": "2024-02-15T20:31:33", "publisherPublication": "2022-04-14T00:00:00", "firstOnline": "2022-04-14"}, "resource_title": "Evett, S. R., Marek, G. W., Colaizzi, P. D., Copeland, K. S., & Ruthardt, B. B. (2022). Methods for downhole soil water sensor calibration\u2014Complications of bulk density and water content variations. Vadose Zone Journal, 21(6). Portico. https://doi.org/10.1002/vzj2.20235", "resource_doi": "10.1002/vzj2.20235"}